      <title>《战神》剧集换角：巴蒂斯塔接棒奎托斯，游戏改编选角再引热议</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260821/%E6%88%98%E7%A5%9E%E5%89%A7%E9%9B%86%E6%8D%A2%E8%A7%92%E5%B7%B4%E8%92%82%E6%96%AF%E5%A1%94%E6%8E%A5%E6%A3%92%E5%A5%8E%E6%89%98%E6%96%AF%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F%E6%94%B9%E7%BC%96%E9%80%89%E8%A7%92%E5%86%8D%E5%BC%95%E7%83%AD%E8%AE%AE/</link>
